{"app":{"schemaVersion":1,"name":"跑步记录","description":"记录每次跑步的日期、距离、耗时、心情、天气和备注，并统计跑步距离。","icon":"🏃","accent":"#176B56","titleField":"date","metricField":"distance","unit":"公里","startScreen":"records","quickAdd":true,"compact":false,"fields":[{"id":"date","label":"跑步日期","type":"date","required":true,"placeholder":"YYYY-MM-DD"},{"id":"distance","label":"距离（公里）","type":"number","required":true,"placeholder":"输入跑步距离，如 5.2"},{"id":"duration","label":"耗时（分钟）","type":"number","required":false,"placeholder":"输入跑步耗时，如 30"},{"id":"mood","label":"心情","type":"choice","required":false,"options":["愉快","平静","一般","疲惫","低落"]},{"id":"notes","label":"备注","type":"text","required":false,"placeholder":"记录路线、天气或跑步感受"},{"id":"weather","label":"天气","type":"choice","required":false,"options":["晴","多云","阴","小雨","大雨","雪","雾","其他"]}]},"explanation":"已增加可选天气字段并开启快速记录入口，全部已有字段、类型及心情选项均保持不变。"}